e299=mk_ev(max_e+3,'community-blog (eslamgaming.com visual evolution Mar 2026; playdreamleaguesoccer.com new features; dlsmod.com venues)','evidence/raw/community_turn30/EV-299_graphics_weather.html',"WARNING: sources below are fan/SEO blogs, NOT official FTG — treat as speculative. Eslamgaming claims DLS26 runs proprietary FTG engine with PBR lighting, ray-traced shadows on high-end PC (shadow mapping on mobile), dynamic weather (rain = wet pitch with reflections/slippery traction/ball physics; snow = accumulation/reduced visibility/riskier long passes; fog = visibility reduction). Playdreamleaguesoccer claims 'FTG Engine 6.0' (Unity 2023 LTS), ECS-based physics, GPU instancing crowds, adaptive resolution targeting 60fps on devices as old as Redmi Note 9; new stadiums (Salt Lake Kolkata, DY Patil Mumbai, Underground Night Arena), ray tracing consoles, 4K textures. DLSmod confirms night stadiums, pinch/rotate camera in Customise section. Treat engine/weather details as unconfirmed — only 'dynamic cutscenes, new walkouts, stadium flyovers, enhanced lighting/refined models' are confirmed in DLS25 press release; weather/engine specifics are community speculation until in-client verification.")
C("Cloud save / account linking (OFFICIAL FTG policy): DLS26 (like UCS/S!H/S!M) links profiles via in-game Settings → 'Sign in with Google' (Android) or 'Sign in with Apple' (iOS 13+). This is NOT Google Play Games / iCloud / Facebook / Game Center — those services are explicitly NOT used. Same-OS additional devices: sign in with same Google/Apple account. OFFICIALLY, cross-platform (Android↔iOS) save/IAP transfer is NOT supported. Signing out unlinks the profile and risks permanent loss on uninstall/device change.",'High Confidence',[e297],vol='Low')
C("Community claim (SakibPro, DLS26): Settings → Advanced → Manage Device → Generate Code produces a one-time transfer code valid 5 minutes; enter on new device via Settings → Advanced → Link Profile. Max 3 devices per profile sharing career; reported to work cross-platform (Android↔iOS). This DIRECTLY CONTRADICTS official FTG support (which says no cross-platform transfer) — may reflect a new DLS26 feature added after the support article's Dec-2024 update OR may be inaccurate. TREAT AS UNVERIFIED until tested in-client.",'Speculative',[e297],['Directly contradicts official FTG support articles dated May/Dec 2024; needs in-client verification.'],vol='High')
C("Friend system (DLS25+ carried into DLS26): permanent friend list via Profile (top-right) → Friends icon (bottom-left) → Generate Code (one-time 5-minute-expiry alphanumeric code) → other player uses Add Account with the code. Added friends display their current division in each other's lists. Friend codes observed as 6-char alphanumeric strings (e.g. SQVDMN, JLNBYL).",'High Confidence',[e298,'EV-280'])
C("Friend Match (online friendly): Dream League Live → Friend Match → enter shared room code (A-Z, 0-9, hyphen allowed). Both players enter the same code → P2P connection established → match starts. Mundodls reports P2P (no dedicated servers) via temporary IP link; works cross-region/device with stable connection. Friend Match stats are tracked in-game.",'High Confidence',[e298])
